1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 6=

19
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,200
(Blaze Demon Nexus)

20
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,200
My lord,

21
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:56,560
all clues about Shanyao Village
and the Rakshasa Bird

22
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,359
have been eliminated.

23
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:04,280
I let you off this time.

24
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,359
If something goes wrong again,

25
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:09,280
do not expect any mercy.

26
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,199
No way, I'm not letting this go.

27
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,120
I will uncover the truth.

28
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:22,400
If Jinshan Temple is truly involved,

29
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,080
I won't show leniency.

30
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,599
Xu Xian, what about you?

31
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,360
I'll investigate too.

32
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,919
I thought the trail
on the snake demon went cold,

33
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:39,319
but when I probed Rakshasa Bird's mind,

34
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:42,280
I actually sensed
the snake demon's power

35
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,360
on the groom.

36
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:49,159
Wait, wasn't the groom
from Jinshan Temple?

37
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:52,960
Young Master Xu,
I've been meaning to ask you.

38
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,360
Why are you so obsessed
with the snake demon?

39
00:02:58,919 --> 00:03:01,479
The snake demon killed my parents.

40
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:03,919
What?

41
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:07,520
You're tracking the snake demon
for revenge?

42
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,000
Then do you know that...

43
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,360
Know what?

44
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,400
She likes you very much.

45
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,840
We're talking business, don't interrupt.

46
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:36,360
Wait, I am talking business, I...

47
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,360
Are you sleepy?

48
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,759
He...

49
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:43,960
When he used the Pagoda,

50
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,599
he exhausted his energy and powers.

51
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,159
He's tired. I'll take him back.

52
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:06,360
Then you go back too.

53
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,479
No, I'm staying here.

54
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,960
What?

55
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:16,360
No, don't!

56
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,600
Can you keep your mouth shut?

57
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,680
One more word,

58
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:22,879
and I'll turn you into a mute puppet

59
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:25,000
to serve me day and night.

60
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:32,279
To think the top disciple
of Jinshan Temple

61
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,199
should be threatened by a demon?

62
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,240
Kill me, but don't disgrace me.

63
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,480
Kneel down!

64
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,160
Kill me if you dare!

65
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,759
I won't kill you,

66
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:44,839
but can you hold your tongue?

67
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:46,759
Is that how you ask for a favor?

68
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,519
Rise.

69
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:54,519
- Can you do it now?
- No!

70
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,519
Kneel down!

71
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,160
Miss Bai,

72
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:15,519
we've spent so much time together.

73
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:17,120
Now we're alone in a room.

74
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:19,488
If word gets out,
it's bad for your name.

75
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,680
Will you tell anyone?

76
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,839
I absolutely won't.

77
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:22,839
Then I won't either.

78
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,399
It'll just be our secret.

79
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,240
You...

80
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,439
Can't you be a little more reserved?

81
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,480
You like reserved girls?

82
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,120
It's not about being reserved!

83
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,959
Young Master Xu, come here.

84
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,399
You... Get out!

85
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:04,199
- Xu Xian!
- Get out!

86
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,199
Xu Xian!

87
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,399
Can you do it now?

88
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,879
Well, I suppose I could.

89
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,680
Let me tell you.

90
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:23,680
Suzhen and I were guided by Goddess
to come down for her tribulation,

91
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,720
not to harm anyone.

92
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,879
Tribulation?

93
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,439
What's wrong? Any problem with that?

94
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,560
No problem, no problem at all!

95
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,720
Do you believe me now?

96
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:34,800
I do! I believe all of it.

97
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:41,439
Sister, can I get up to use the latrine?

98
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,399
Go then.

99
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:49,399
Thank you.

100
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,439
Xu Xian! Xu...

101
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:56,040
That dense Xu Xian drives me crazy!

102
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,040
I want him dead.

103
00:06:59,199 --> 00:07:01,000
You dared to lie to me!

104
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:04,192
You said you didn't want to hurt anyone!

105
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,759
Hurt anyone?

106
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:08,519
Suzhen, he insists
we want to kill Xu Xian!

107
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,199
I was just
speaking out of anger earlier.

108
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,079
How can you prove that?

109
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:17,120
How can you prove
you didn't kill Xu Xian's parents?

110
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,879
Of course I'm not!

111
00:07:20,439 --> 00:07:21,839
Guided by the Goddess,

112
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:23,560
I came to resolve my karma with him.

113
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,720
I follow the way of heaven,

114
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,399
solely to transcend and ascend.

115
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,600
Miss Bai,

116
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,040
it's easy to make up stories.

117
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,360
How can I believe you?

118
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:42,639
Don't push your luck.

119
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:44,839
I'm not, I'm not!

120
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,639
You're a disciple of Jinshan Temple.

121
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:48,279
Can't you tell if I'm telling the truth?

122
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:16,120
Alright, you're telling the truth.

123
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,560
Is she to repay a kindness too?

124
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:21,000
Wherever Suzhen goes, I go.

125
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:24,199
She's here for her trial,
so naturally I follow.

126
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,240
What, got a problem?

127
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:28,439
Fine.

128
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:32,000
Can you keep your mouth shut now?

129
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,600
If I must.

130
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,039
Not a word.

131
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:41,919
Who called me? What is it?

132
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,679
What do you need me for?

133
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,720
Nothing.

134
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,039
Nothing.

135
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,080
Nothing.

136
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,159
Greetings, ladies.

137
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:58,799
What about the matter
I told you to investigate?

138
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,240
As for that groom of the Rakshasa Bird,

139
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,799
I only found out he's a mortal.

140
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:06,120
After slaughtering the whole
Rakshasa Bird clan, he vanished.

141
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:11,519
The Rakshasa Bird bride turned
into a vengeful spirit after dying,

142
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,600
lingering around endlessly.

143
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:15,519
Then do you know where to find her?

144
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,879
As long as there's a wedding.

145
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:18,639
A wedding?

146
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,559
She was killed at her wedding,

147
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:23,559
so she holds
deep resentment toward weddings.

148
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:26,799
She showed up
at several weddings in town,

149
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:27,799
slaying the newlyweds.

150
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,440
Now, nobody dares to hold a wedding.

151
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:32,559
So that's it?

152
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:33,919
That's it.

153
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,480
Then you can leave.

154
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:40,440
Well, ladies, gathering intel
is exhausting...

155
00:09:42,159 --> 00:09:43,159
You can leave.

156
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:44,159
Right away!

157
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:48,519
Suzhen, this little bunny is so cute!

158
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,840
How long have you known Miss Bai?

159
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,879
Did she ever hurt you?

160
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,120
Yes.

161
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:15,919
Really?

162
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,159
Is it harm if she insists

163
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:20,679
on marrying me?

164
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:26,399
As the top disciple of Jinshan Temple,

165
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,208
I can't believe you out-flexed me.

166
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,360
What are you trying to say?

167
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,720
Young Master Xu...

168
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,399
Actually, Qing...

169
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,720
What was that?

170
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,360
Nothing.

171
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,360
Nothing at all!

172
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,360
You wouldn't dare anyway.

173
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:51,000
We found out how
to locate the Rakshasa Bird's spirit.

174
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,240
How do we locate it?

175
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,000
You have to marry me.

176
00:11:00,799 --> 00:11:01,919
I'll investigate on my own.

177
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,320
You two...

178
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,600
What a tragedy!

179
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,960
What Suzhen means is,

180
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:15,080
to find the Rakshasa Bird,
we need to hold a wedding.

181
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:20,799
A wedding?

182
00:11:23,639 --> 00:11:26,519
Ridiculous! You've read
too many romance novels!

183
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,240
Haven't you noticed

184
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:30,600
there hasn't been a single wedding
in town lately?

185
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,240
I hadn't noticed.

186
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:42,039
We usually perform rites for the dead.

187
00:11:42,559 --> 00:11:45,039
Nobody hires us for weddings.

188
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:51,399
The Rakshasa Bird
is obsessed with weddings.

189
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,559
She always shows up to ruin them.

190
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:57,320
The townsfolk are terrified
and stopped holding weddings.

191
00:11:57,559 --> 00:12:00,120
So, if you marry Suzhen

192
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,519
and hold a wedding,

193
00:12:01,639 --> 00:12:02,919
it'll lure out Rakshasa Bird.

194
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,080
No way!

195
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,240
Absolutely not!

196
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:13,799
I think it could work.

197
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,120
The Rakshasa Bird often mentioned

198
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:20,279
hearing her sister wailing
in the dead of night.

199
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:23,200
It seems her sister
holds deep resentment.

200
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:25,919
If holding a wedding

201
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:27,720
can lure out her sister's spirit,

202
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:31,440
then it's worth a try.

203
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,919
Even a fake wedding works,

204
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,072
as long as it's a wedding.

205
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:37,440
But for a fake wedding,

206
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:39,799
we still need a bride and a groom.

207
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:44,399
I'm definitely not the right fit.

208
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:48,120
And it's even more impossible for me.

209
00:12:50,279 --> 00:12:53,120
Then the groom has to be you,
Young Master Xu.

210
00:12:54,919 --> 00:12:57,120
Congratulations, Xu Xian!

211
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,639
You're getting a wife!

212
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,159
No.

213
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:02,600
Throwing a wedding is too troublesome.

214
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:04,200
Need a bridal sedan,

215
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:05,840
invitations,

216
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,200
wedding candies, and...

217
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,480
- Everything's ready.
- Everything's ready.

218
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:12,279
Everything's ready.

219
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:17,399
(Zuixian Restaurant)
Thank you, everyone!

220
00:13:17,399 --> 00:13:19,159
Thank you all for coming!

221
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:20,399
Thank you, everyone!

222
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:21,720
Please, come inside! Come on in!

223
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,120
- Thank you.
- Congratulations!

224
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,120
Come on in, please.

225
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,120
Come on in, please.

226
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,120
Thank you!

227
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:29,480
They actually rented the restaurant
to hold a wedding.

228
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,320
I can't tell if it's absurd

229
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,440
or just novel.

230
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,039
Trouble follows every wedding lately.

231
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:37,320
This couple really has a death wish.

232
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,000
What do you know?

233
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,720
That's called true love!

234
00:13:47,399 --> 00:13:49,519
Today is Young Master Xu's big day!

235
00:13:49,519 --> 00:13:51,080
Thank you, everyone!

236
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,200
Thank you!

237
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,336
- Congratulations!
- Thank you, everyone!

238
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,639
- Congratulations!
- Wish you eternal love.

239
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:58,320
Why are you so late?

240
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,320
Been waiting for ages.

241
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,720
Do you know how long I've waited?

242
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,919
Why so many people?

243
00:14:01,919 --> 00:14:02,919
Well, it's a wedding!

244
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:04,240
How can there be no guests?

245
00:14:05,639 --> 00:14:06,639
Smile! Smile!

246
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,200
Thank you, everyone!

247
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,240
Please, come on in!

248
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,279
Welcome! Welcome!

249
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:11,279
Please, come on in!

250
00:14:12,399 --> 00:14:13,399
Lord Zhang!

251
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:16,200
Who are all these people?

252
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,480
Pilgrims! They're all temple pilgrims!

253
00:14:19,559 --> 00:14:22,000
Can you stop looking so tense?

254
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:24,399
Smile, it's your wedding!

255
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,480
Thank you, thank you!

256
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:31,919
Hurry up!

257
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:33,399
It's here! The bridal sedan is here!

258
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,759
Go on down! Go!

259
00:14:54,822 --> 00:14:58,981
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

260
00:15:01,448 --> 00:15:05,826
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

261
00:15:07,369 --> 00:15:13,194
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

262
00:15:39,848 --> 00:15:44,007
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

263
00:15:46,474 --> 00:15:50,852
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

264
00:15:52,395 --> 00:15:58,220
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

265
00:15:58,989 --> 00:16:03,456
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

266
00:16:06,321 --> 00:16:10,762
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

267
00:16:12,958 --> 00:16:17,688
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

268
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:25,013
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

269
00:16:25,676 --> 00:16:31,458
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

270
00:16:31,458 --> 00:16:37,721
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

271
00:16:38,031 --> 00:16:44,390
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

272
00:16:44,561 --> 00:16:51,928
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

273
00:16:52,213 --> 00:16:57,760
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

274
00:16:58,251 --> 00:17:04,461
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

275
00:17:04,771 --> 00:17:11,544
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

276
00:17:12,541 --> 00:17:18,194
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

277
00:17:19,028 --> 00:17:23,436
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

278
00:17:24,201 --> 00:17:26,789
♪Having ever loved♪
